{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1287,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be9735f665947aa79f29dd5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "洗衣服的事不用担心。\r\n业者会处理。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5eee6073e556eefda35c9df1439abef9305e4471ee02c98f9dba96fb55a6607",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42ec1b2b8d47b5a3f9fd17f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ククッ、私が考え抜いたデザイン…\r\n早く実証実験に及びたいねぇ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "437f0405bb4df403161cf35285cdb345279d3107da6db2c864959b837afd08de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beb3ee6ba56317212fd7616c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ああ、リボンの色はね…\r\n研究対象を識別するための比較表だよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "407d5383a2a086ea6a341f1ab2d4632122defdb580f64c2afa89b7ef920513ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93ede05d4809367c53948e66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然没什么特别之处，但穿起来感觉不错哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b06bb4993a67ee10ade750f4a425281d68bcb040ab2f8c7bac3f9f6a2f2549f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a88bf56d926a90757f7982f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各方面制作起来都很容易的服装，\r\n但它能承受住剧烈运动吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b31b1d011719fc36f8a42534ebb360b2aa9fc2c102bdc69ba97ae47cf0a82d95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d593d058ac8c677a13cf148f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服怎么样\r\n是不是正合适？",
      "source_fingerprint": "955e13562088bd8aabb88344539bf36d560c16a91021827496a2510ed1c73613",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:febd417a84b3745717a5db4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服，在实验时\r\n弄坏了好几次呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "3571f0d1b1de26cc59bd788f76aa816c5972daf22c73060c8aa41001218a53e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:543aa219ec1b31976198d21e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这应该是世人眼中很可爱的一种服装吧，\r\n但说实话我不太能理解呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b374a12cf33110f6c18a05b179202e85f93fe082490391db5e9684dc20cf995",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb45fb58a742850d602a01e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，穿上这套衣服，研究意愿就涌出来了！\r\n我可以做实验吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "088916a1719b597bb4cf7563e11f89559a0b9809dfa43d1cd0ddcc562d4e19ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0aed69b7e8f8ab57fd7bc2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你很好奇我的包包装了什么吗？\r\n呵呵，不告诉你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db7dac3e7ba2889cbf5e6a9b2b4c4538481b2f8b96c6d6c870549561262c12a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:476a5ef66f45a3be07a1a0e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能不能再多增加几支试管呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa2735fd8712ae680c5f04710d862035d5a94fc72372db8ac9844a16ce36a194",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:383a9502358a9692048153ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a977ca8e3137e67a7a6918a06d3d86d57fbf577994f726c5155115e0a2b3071a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00f4fed08b261926b5c71b0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧，向着那可能性的尽头……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "021c7308c082875485a9ba0a15577918a1e6ca33d79205d025fbfc5101a94246",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0872bee05c64cec9eefc24db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ククッ、私が考え抜いたデザイン…\r\n早く実証実験に及びたいねぇ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "437f0405bb4df403161cf35285cdb345279d3107da6db2c864959b837afd08de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "71216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66a2eb5930cb2f0e4469544a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ああ、リボンの色はね…\r\n研究対象を識別するための比較表だよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "407d5383a2a086ea6a341f1ab2d4632122defdb580f64c2afa89b7ef920513ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "71217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cc0db719c287cec19ac484e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お疲れ様",
      "source_fingerprint": "b953841c6237f6f93550f5268f577fd573201293558ed014b9eb53c636e0c0c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:343d3b4db2b93210cbf9b8cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要让我看看你作为实验体\r\n的价值哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2e4261fba70fbfff8e619c226113aca5744fadd99291ce49fd97589752bf95b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e3aa604a8dae1da3e0b40a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "桀桀，\r\n调查得还远远不够呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e95527aba0b2da8b23e8051b9627ec3ccc7f31fb45eae33e27d8b091c3553671",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a114af1c40b401fbdf130376",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好，训练员君。\r\n来，把胳膊伸出来。\r\n今天从验血开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0066c2fd8b86cfcde7f852f42b45463f02976ab52a61493aac824329b5ab4e96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a0bbfc41d218c6eea80ba82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀哎呀，你总算来了！\r\n那咱们马上开始实验吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de732f7630bb659085dc8ea478656fba0a439b4ab594f53ecbbdc1edaef52e69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "900000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8171ed2b876332223ea8d941",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太棒了！这回\r\n得到了充足的研究成果哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a24819ec1f73e84c8b89cfd74e7823e794269ed3e4ad84ade41faf85883e463f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "900001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d1ee07445739e23c2a99932",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "度过了一段很有意义的时光。\r\n下回再来找你帮忙哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac00fd5910df8e8e85cdb4583bb48028bdd401c6fcaa76017b0d1992d52f86ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "900002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4430aee8c9d5455a2f4b989c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "研究报告，\r\n派得上用场吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "08eee820e8197ff26481ae3269307095d41e35da67a75813e82f108be82e5769",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "900003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cacf302ed10f193fae2f232",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さぁ、研究を始めようじゃないか！\r\n有望な助手との共同研究…予想外の\r\n化学反応を期待してしまうねえ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19bedfd47b4e4ea65c9d702f396513ab4ddd1f81b2be6367ef39d4c46c02db8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "900004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f6f3bf5c634fdf5697db464",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "協力ご苦労。今回も興味深い\r\n結果を得られた！さっそく\r\n次なる研究に取りかかるとしよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b6e07f426e86846ac3951c963b62d90281312d35570fcd895178918cea91915",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "900005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30acd4177c0d20d025972e94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この結果はすべて私の個人的な\r\n研究に使わせてもらうとするよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1d578cda5e46fb5999d79966459dbca6727bff51acba4877c2b95aacc6a538a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "900006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfdb7379aa63316bc2127ed1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "研究レポート…使ったらどうだい？\r\nさぁさ、結果をみせておくれよ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d143f33334ee9edc5348dd881cefd7f7a9c9a8455e6c8ec5c253702f450abe90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "900007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:594137578770b6bc53fa8909",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "リスクは重々承知してるとも！\r\nそのうえで…是非！被検体に！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69f5d80e5c0f57d263473afbc36ac2d36c9026f0d968d2784345a2a56fe2785e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "900008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae469a489a9ed1079ae25d6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "未知の可能性を追い求めたくなる…\r\n科学者としての性というところさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59386aa6b3103f927590db3eda053fde24eaf5d040596bcb00420d6a8931c6e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "900009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2b5f4aa11acef8a7f26a631",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊～啊…我在做的研究\r\n有了些进展呢。回过神来\r\n就已经是早上了…呼啊啊啊…",
      "source_fingerprint": "f72f7930e8bf4ed2cd028b1ae462472ef4f8a74325a8c17d66ca54b824a0207b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbb80648e9b991fe9eea95a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我下午想开展新的实验来着，\r\n在那之前可否请你\r\n去跑个10km呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "68600a35c9a960a4d02c51cc44ad335c3ed44436c3ccb2da6fde41b6e300f8d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:326bf057e27040c784cf1e54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃完午饭了吗？\r\n我给你准备一杯饭后茶吧。\r\n放心，味道很普通的。只是味道哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82b0221f9953586239c08e0dd6618f2344167d57d9216e255f3a3e99d99cbedb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9ef3b0eb8344d2f1b2c86fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "睡不着觉的话，我给你准备了\r\n自己珍藏的药哦。虽然代价是会做恶梦，\r\n不过也没什么问题！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89e7ee9ec37b53078057d3fc31e0cccef4bd65305cf293d3b60a8f575e58a5e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f85cf004b29bb334d619cefd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "都到晚上了也没见训练员君的\r\n肌肉有什么变化…早上掺的药失败了吗。\r\n哎呀，遗憾遗憾！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53541cdca6c7763493b5f0a79d9e35881b2562e7157ae7d91416579e931d2a16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d264030fb163229b9dc83ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到那些纯真的马娘，我心里可激动了。\r\n有没有适合当作实验体的孩子呢～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5449a4cfcb380f17613ceb6427cebb1f65586547070ad3290d9b91dc93785a50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d7b1d2054abb961431866c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我尊敬的人很多，\r\n但对发明空调的人，\r\n我每年都想给他写感谢信呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1ec87a9c77a89e41bd3a86c8836b08e77339e40267b1ad28f5b980cbd971862",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a651e99b9db966e5322ce50c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "实验之秋呢…桀桀。\r\n…哦呀？你刚才吓了一跳吗？\r\n是痉挛了吗。好，我来给你检查一下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4fb31e0630b0a11f7a87a6756dd53c966343099b6d072996c696d47ebeb0c35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbb122d19d60d038c3226b6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我给你试做了一份感冒预防药。\r\n放心喝下去吧。\r\n身体发光的话就说明起作用了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36837dafd5d4412ba3cc7efaf91681c6c8d0473e999c165745975b9e4e46d2e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2bca8d8b47602355163943d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安，训练员。\r\n你有确实做好热身运动了吗？\r\n问我为什么……你应该明白吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "806dfd4bea27fda996866ef41728655259d4576f315214e80880837e2d77cb00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c015f8de046bacff6a0db06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "劝你不要在整晚没睡后的早晨泡澡，\r\n因为会溺水的，就像我一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e895a14f24e947eeaf6d3e4c902ad9f9a57468b122dc7de7ff09dbc5d011d33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01154e3b8ae81e0c07c669e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仔细看我扁扁的肚子吧。\r\n再这样下去我会饿倒在路边的。\r\n放心啦，吃海鲜料理我也接受！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b464560cf741fd30e9840008933dc0b995b4f4459afdf04c847764ac36b5588",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:364855a4f140f1985bc648ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下午到海边做实验吧。\r\n我想拿你调查沙浴的效果。\r\n别担心，我会确实把你埋下去的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eff99c4741d9a09660128ebf6ef35b9c569cb6ddf100f6bf46200a7e3d49c2c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc6ce5db9bd671d4641603ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……晚上好像有点冷。\r\n训练员，把你的衣服借给我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d30081e752a6be94611070f5f9c9beedc88fe64114775e909706846b64474c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7078cb11aa86e98690f0bce5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我完成了将海浪声转换为电流\r\n来刺激脑部的「绝对好眠装置」！\r\n记得明天前写份报告交上来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6a31ddc6c194b4d9cb4149023993286161e328820fd4459bb5a3a7140b17f1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:873742726bbda82d2fa19e84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天真不错，能够让我感受到\r\n生命那强烈的气息呢。话虽如此，\r\n我穿成这样真的会感冒吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bc5b3105fe27cb2c717d8ed254f6294e7a5d5b6679f318917181a8e1d47acec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41255ece80865e04ac85e747",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是日照不强的日子也不能大意。\r\n对了，我来帮你涂个好东西吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57606a7e6140a2c98aa3f62cd2e4355434a77429bf539dc8e4fd188d2ae6eca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21532febf1871c961b04856c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我喜欢足不出户，\r\n但露营也挺不错的呢。\r\n在河边做实验别有一番乐趣吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea89696e2bf940b0233179b4b9e4dd397cbdee1d8bb868106ad5b315e92db61a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:688c0f2e2b8d38435d34a080",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚泳池里的水竟然是冰的啦……\r\n我是不是应该让自己\r\n能够自由调整肤觉呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fb3ee129caafc5d4a5f2ae45185f73616da58b39cf136f41d815a160bce7c36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ba1af1b23a555ffd682c739",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "甜食日快乐呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "20b111871325bbd27191659b6fe14d416c2d3f4dfb4e9914b81e3531b81c2add",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1d1fec5e1785fc87ea701c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "甜食日快乐呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "20b111871325bbd27191659b6fe14d416c2d3f4dfb4e9914b81e3531b81c2add",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0491f0f088992126716cd7fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "実にいい朝だ！僅かな眠気を、\r\n那由他の彼方へ押しやる1杯の\r\n紅茶があれば、なおいいのだが？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a66520caea97f6f00c95eea7b7cdef9a01fa8180aadb2ffec41ad78702d2d1cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7502656cc38ce2874923eb75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜半から日の出まで起きていると\r\n徹夜になるなら…日の出にあわせて\r\n仮眠をとればセーフじゃないかい？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1faf63f4630642177c9a9dd14aa71863f8dc006dae6b259b2ee62e4c4cd4af3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:100d82108347e04403319623",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脳が栄養を求めている。さぁ、\r\n早急に補給しておくれ！世界に\r\n大きな損失が発生してしまうよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2b3bcab0271bd615e4d96db9085850063e8eb198f57a5edbd191730dc542f7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fac72462436e58c5956790e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ランチはカフェでとるといい！\r\nどの道、君の机に資料を広げていて\r\n使えるスペースがないからね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90cf1128d4b122f12e67d4b2ef3841fd12ccff6b8a0d9c774c8cb95f802122ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35fe728f6a7eea153edddcbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こんな時間にまで会いに来るとは、\r\n君のモルモット精神は評価に値する\r\nおかげで眠気も消えてしまったよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c72761482cc458393813fdddc6a16851f6fd5e313962e39f078d51cce4f3d42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfdbc708a2039a9153e035df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日も暮れたのに溌剌な生徒たちだ…\r\n全員研究に値する対象だよ！\r\nさ、一緒に観察しようじゃないか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b2c2e2653b344ac90eae39b9ef29d6d7b80792e793a5496188cfc839c065432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:863782ab901b89aab98018f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この時期は新しい研究材料…\r\nもとい、新入生を迎える時期。\r\n実に心躍る季節だねぇ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33ad3f3f6e7b898a7979123a53181373b3105806d3736bffb52502b946a6e884",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07c478f5d9ee765e5412098d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カフェの近くにいると体感温度が\r\n下がる瞬間があってね…どうにか\r\n意図的に発動できないものか…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d3836c346624c1ce79eaa9377422d97a75d10c0f66f701898ec240bfd34b730",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87ee9e1902cceeff287b08bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食欲、運動、読書…とくれば、\r\n実験の秋でも構わないだろう！\r\nさ、横になってくれたまえ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7538f641e2cc672b035b2a9b38b2bde6e2f2d484e694582a222b7ace188ee55b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d6d66f739509de9b0751ed3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寒さがいかに走りに影響を\r\n与えるか…実験には比較が必要。\r\nとはいえ体を冷やすのは…酷だね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2cf2c8e24cbcd8c4512f1e9e9985ace09562f875d9ea3708e8b5bc84877c766",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcc6526ce75547c7627deca5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピー甘味物の日だねぇ",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca47e01f600f8fceb2caa26be716209f9320b120858ff231598d3bf3bfcd3db2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca7fb3a85d32f93dea08122b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算我想偷偷做实验，\r\n也总是会被茶座发现…\r\n嗯…她难道有什么特殊能力吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88137bd026471f4765d9438729aa3b58e98fb1c58b307eb815e43dab81ff1d30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c67658717736d62cd89582e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "速子虽然指『超光速粒子』…\r\n但我所向往的目标，\r\n还在那更前方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fecbd3ad0877e35130e73afac257cc2bfc5878e29c233162d86cedb826a8a86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bc0215e82a643fa09c7c249",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我平时都是个观察者…\r\n但和数码君在一起的话，就能了解到\r\n被观察者的心情，感觉很新鲜哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6495944e8a6a4fb867715303d9d28a3cc85cbb2a31a95efc436838f49507fb38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76af2b63b146c491e7a68504",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有比服用兴奋剂更无趣的行为了。\r\n我所追求的是永恒的速度…\r\n药物不过是探寻可能性的道具罢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1d5f052568fdfb9343877fabce176f87617660a4d8e386fb701dc05b6fe1a4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17ea078d6914e49bc58da479",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的家人基本上都秉持着放任主义呢。\r\n也多亏他们，我从小时候起\r\n就能够专心于研究了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb72fc77993cacab242709655ea94264c277f6b9b3eb61f399f9d23c369c0135",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1dc9e4a3d52d8307715b956",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想把存储介质装在衣服上来着…\r\n但不知道能否改造至\r\n在舞台上不会暴露的程度呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b48cb4d628d468ecea8cec64802e6a746be5f6ba380c6ee2aa465496a32308a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe4d1998f83a86ecb9654f1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要一边观察着舞台上的马娘们\r\n还要一边跳舞…收集数据\r\n也是很辛苦的啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfc503593023c8b551a2d18a949f67184e956b6be0e06baf844de8a475c6dfa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52b3d971d84d0dc712b1e051",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "令人心情高涨的服装呢。\r\n穿上它，在比赛中也能\r\n顺利进行实验…桀桀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee60af564d98fe75c53d9bbf8a7aec98a83501d6548a0c68215053666da85927",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:684a834ba6f6ea844db7aeeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "探求之心是没有尽头的。\r\n也是无论何时都不会消失的。\r\n这件衣服就是其具现化的存在哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ef6378add964da47da02975fc545e487067c5e1a93e47634842eaebe0db4188",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aee131ce3142f87194d43e7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我真是太喜欢你迷迷糊糊的样子了。\r\n没什么深层含义哦。\r\n仅仅是方便我做实验罢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f403e58d5247a376ead2ae3f87eaebdd9738c743bce2c39ac35517ea3ef92c40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8f2a9873ffc441a6717f77a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员君，午睡要提前\r\n跟我打个招呼哦。\r\n我做了各种各样的准备呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "026d034edfb69a18600b3d29fb79a9a69108eb919b8f9da6e724e6ed3e4ac893",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cbc2a853b804f7e0c4beeac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与其去喝咖啡提神，\r\n倒不如来陪我做实验，\r\n提神效果更佳哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e7b9571bcfb2a8bfbaf4f945eb43de51574ea74c9e81517b4bcd7a9b4a49e73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c953b7d0c5f4fd64bb3b9341",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有种说法，蝴蝶的鳞粉具有\r\n减弱空气阻力的能力。\r\n…你，要不要敷在腿上试试？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4aee538a0ff6056dc5d5440dab6e339ba7541a193829dcfa4da8dde31ea0f02f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f531aa93e1434ade5e29ff4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员君，要时刻保持房间内的凉爽哦？\r\n因为夏季的炎热会令我的思考能力\r\n严重下降呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79c5a98d0fb3298c2a54fbb686af05ad30875d22e1e5cd4163d3bcbffa38b775",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e40987dd1012fdb3a8e12cdd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有种好办法可以度过漫长秋夜…\r\n喂，不要在我说出来之前\r\n就开始警戒啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c7078735eabedc06037e3ed00f2d657f5e80a481054b152ccd67ab4e2046d5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9abdfd00978164ede80de566",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抵抗寒冷需要将受体细胞…\r\n不对，要从根本上解决的话…阿嚏！\r\n呜呜，暖气开得还是太早了吗…",
      "source_fingerprint": "c661efa2a11d99f8eb739e6e80239df1b5a71550c524d343e47f994114cd2167",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9e1c91ab37f9c4e5f0ed0c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子好像想要一件可爱又\r\n引人注目的泳装。帮她加上\r\n萤火虫那种发光物质好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fed0f1c0fab07ce0ddc273e0030089b6f0260de402790d2047c7baa9240b6cb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49bc22a1f7c8773991519814",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赤骥很认真，所以我就来送她个\r\n「能够放松身心和骨骼的\r\n仿真度假装置」吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d41ebfd85edefd5a966e3c7a3584107676729aa9df2a732d214fe038167beed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a665884e2ff368e712b662c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "铃鹿喃喃说着「想要迈向\r\n水平线的彼端」……好，我来把她的\r\n肉体改造成能够在水面上跑步吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff53717f398b302250bcf6ba9a12e66589b49297ef4689ecc5b32bdfc3480b68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91018"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
